<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">DYMO-Hair: Generalizable Volumetric <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">DY</span>namics <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">MO</span>deling 
<br class="ltx_break">for Robot <span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">Hair</span> Manipulation
</h1>
